<i>the escaped convict accused</i>
<i>of sticking up Toys "R" Us</i>

2113
02:02:31,650 --> 02:02:33,990
<i>and torching</i>
<i>a dentist's office,</i>
<i>how does he feel?</i>

2114
02:02:34,120 --> 02:02:36,320
My belief is that, um,

2115
02:02:36,460 --> 02:02:39,060
as a church,
you got to stand with somebody.

2116
02:02:39,190 --> 02:02:41,600
Doesn't mean that you agree
with what they did.

2117
02:02:41,730 --> 02:02:43,660
The Roofman,
or the Rooftop Robber,

2118
02:02:43,800 --> 02:02:46,200
I-I never heard
anything about that.

2119
02:02:46,330 --> 02:02:49,040
It was--
I was oblivious to anything

2120
02:02:49,170 --> 02:02:52,110
until after my relationship
with Jeffrey,

2121
02:02:52,240 --> 02:02:53,770
and then he was captured.

2122
02:02:53,910 --> 02:02:55,280
Then it just seemed
to be everywhere.

2123
02:02:55,410 --> 02:02:57,480
Never thought that
would happen to my office,

2124
02:02:57,610 --> 02:03:00,080
him trying to burn it down
to-to hide his record.

2125
02:03:00,210 --> 02:03:02,620
The whole front area was gone.

2126
02:03:02,750 --> 02:03:04,080
In the beginning,
it just seemed to me

2127
02:03:04,220 --> 02:03:05,590
he had everything together.

2128
02:03:05,720 --> 02:03:11,260
And it's a perfect example
of how greed and money

2129
02:03:11,390 --> 02:03:16,260
and bad influences in your life
could change your outcome.

2130
02:03:16,400 --> 02:03:17,970
<i>Pastor Smith says</i>

2131
02:03:18,100 --> 02:03:19,730
<i>he's already visited</i>
<i>Manchester in jail.</i>

2132
02:03:19,870 --> 02:03:22,970
He could not believe
that I came to see him,

2133
02:03:23,100 --> 02:03:27,410
that, um, that we would
not just be really mad at him

2134
02:03:27,540 --> 02:03:28,940
and turn our back on him.

2135
02:03:29,080 --> 02:03:30,140
<i>Although it was</i>
<i>a church member</i>

2136
02:03:30,280 --> 02:03:31,650
<i>who turned Manchester in.</i>

2137
02:03:31,780 --> 02:03:33,080
<i>Police captured him</i>

2138
02:03:33,210 --> 02:03:34,680
<i>leaving the apartment</i>
<i>of Leigh Wainscott,</i>

2139
02:03:34,810 --> 02:03:36,950
<i>the new girlfriend he met</i>
<i>at a church singles event.</i>

2140
02:03:37,080 --> 02:03:41,660
I talked to my oldest daughter,
you know, about this,

2141
02:03:41,790 --> 02:03:44,060
um, recently,
and, uh, I asked her

2142
02:03:44,190 --> 02:03:47,800
to share with me
anything that she remembered,

2143
02:03:47,930 --> 02:03:51,130
um, that she could share,
and she just said,

2144
02:03:51,270 --> 02:03:53,230
"Oh, yeah,
I remember very well.

2145
02:03:53,370 --> 02:03:54,900
"He was, he was awesome,
you know.

2146
02:03:55,040 --> 02:03:56,340
"We had so much fun."

2147
02:03:56,470 --> 02:03:58,940
And, um...

2148
02:03:59,070 --> 02:04:02,280
They didn't have anything bad
to say about him.

2149
02:04:02,410 --> 02:04:04,140
Nothing at all.